6
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:28.230
মেনুতে আপনার জন্য সবচেয়ে বেশি জিনিস।
Recruitment অংশে Requisitions,

7
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:33.958
Candidates, Talent Bank,
Approval Sheets, Medical Requests।

8
00:00:34.078 --> 00:00:39.710
Configuration-এ Unit Config,
Approval Paths,

9
00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:46.390
AI Settings, Board Groups,
AI Proficiency Bank। একটা একটা করে দেখব।

10
00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.830
